<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><oois xmlns="http://www.outdooractive.com/api/"><tour id="806658770" type="5250" frontendtype="tour" ranking="86.0"><category id="1589846" name="Trails" iconUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/maroon/mountainbiking.square_vector.svg" iconInactiveUrl="https://res.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/grey80/mountainbiking.square_vector.svg" iconMapUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/maroon/mountainbiking.map_vector.svg" iconInactiveMapUrl="https://res.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/grey80/mountainbiking.map_vector.svg" iconTransparentUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/mountainbiking.geocontent.png" strokeColor="#ff0000" mapOverlays="mtb"><datatype>mountainbiking</datatype></category><title>SH 45 12er Sky-Line am Zwölferkogel</title><localizedTitle lang="en"><value>SH 45 12er Sky-Line on Zwölferkogel</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="fr"><value>SH 45 12er Sky-Line au Zwölferkogel</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="es"><value>SH 45 Sky-Line 12er en Zwölferkogel</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="it"><value>SH 45 12er Sky-Line sul Zwölferkogel</value></localizedTitle><shortText>&lt;p>Die neue 12er Sky-Line am Zwölferkogel bietet sowohl Beginnern als auch Fortgeschrittenen Mountainbikern ein abwechslunsreiches Terrain und atemberaubende Ausblick über das Glemmtal.&lt;/p></shortText><longText>&lt;p>Die 12er Sky-Line in Saalbach Hinterglemm bietet ab 2025 ein echtes Highlight für alle, die eine flowige Abfahrt mit atemberaubender Aussicht suchen. Der 6,5 Kilometer lange Trail startet in der oberenSektion des Zwölferkogels, einem der schönsten Panoramapunkte der Region. Hier eröffnet sich den Fahrer:innen ein spektakulärer Blick auf die Kitzbüheler Alpen und das Glemmtal. Der Trail ist perfekt für alle, die ein entspanntes, aber dennoch sportliches Fahrgefühl suchen. Flowige Anlieger, kleine Sprünge und bestens angelegte Kurven machen diesen Trail zu einem unvergesslichen Erlebnis.&lt;/p></longText><primaryImage id="615658971"><title>12er SKY-LINE Saalbach Hinterglemm</title><source>Saalbach Hinterglemm</source><description>Die 12er Sky-Line am Zwölferkogel in Hinterglemm überzeugt mit anfängerfreudnlichem Gelände und atemberaubenden Panoramen.&lt;br/>&lt;br/>https://www.saalbach.com/bike&lt;br/>#mountainbiking #saalbach #austria</description></primaryImage><geometry>12.569022,47.360746,1969 12.568961,47.360822,1967 12.568875,47.360681,1966 12.56881,47.360489,1966 12.56878,47.360434,1966 12.568728,47.360356,1965 12.568684,47.360282,1965 12.568646,47.36021,1965 12.568598,47.360065,1965 12.568391,47.359408,1957 12.568378,47.359341,1957 12.568292,47.359282,1955 12.56819,47.3592,1953 12.568101,47.359068,1952 12.568134,47.358969,1954 12.56804,47.358932,1952 12.567936,47.358811,1950 12.567805,47.358685,1947 12.567729,47.358624,1946 12.567666,47.358561,1946 12.567593,47.358517,1946 12.567262,47.358396,1945 12.566941,47.358363,1940 12.566503,47.358127,1941 12.566368,47.358069,1940 12.56623,47.358025,1939 12.566182,47.357962,1940 12.566059,47.357895,1939 12.565993,47.357845,1939 12.565901,47.357745,1939 12.565781,47.357586,1938 12.565704,47.3575,1938 12.565626,47.357411,1937 12.565393,47.357214,1933 12.565342,47.357156,1933 12.565292,47.357063,1932 12.565096,47.356963,1930 12.564981,47.356865,1929 12.564522,47.356707,1930 12.563907,47.356383,1933 12.563809,47.356371,1933 12.563648,47.356319,1934 12.563566,47.356288,1935 12.563368,47.356168,1934 12.563282,47.356176,1935 12.562732,47.35598,1936 12.562532,47.355899,1935 12.562465,47.355859,1935 12.562414,47.355752,1934 12.562405,47.355682,1934 12.562421,47.355621,1934 12.56248,47.35557,1934 12.562614,47.355491,1932 12.56266,47.355433,1931 12.562685,47.355316,1931 12.562721,47.355263,1930 12.562766,47.355063,1929 12.562734,47.354938,1929 12.562628,47.354868,1929 12.562419,47.354731,1925 12.562323,47.354688,1926 12.562296,47.354621,1926